    "Name": "Incursion ICR-N5-3",
    "Details": "When utilized in a more defensive role, the Incursion ICR-N5 was often found lacking. The upgraded ICR-N5-3 tried to address this by upgrading to double heat sinks and dropping the AMS and Remote Sensor Dispenser. This allowed adding a Medium Laser and a SRM-2 launcher. As a final touch three of the Small Lasers were exchanged for two Machine Guns to improve the heat profile.\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Quirk: Improved Sensors</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Drop Cost Multiplier: 1.1</color></b>\n\n<color=#FFEF00>Arm Actuator Limit: Left Lower</color>",
    "Icon": "uixTxrIcon_battlemaster"
  },
